<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Thorn Strike</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 2)
Mana: 12
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast thorn strike &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast thorn strike</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster makes a stabbing gesture at the target, and a hail of magical 
thorns pierces them. It is the druid's first attack spell: the better 
your divine power and your summoning sphere, the more it hurts. The 
thorns care little what armour the target wears, but a shield can block 
them.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while 
fighting, and no free hands are needed.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
